Phase 0 — Capacity Screening and Regime-Split Estimation

Before any lab or simulator time, estimate  C_{\mathrm{eff}}^{\mathrm{driven}}(\Delta)  and  C_{\mathrm{eff}}^{\mathrm{idle}}(\Delta)  for the two most mature candidates using data already in print.

