18. Research Philosophy

The objective of the next iteration is not to make the proposal sound more impressive. It is to make it harder to be wrong.

The architecture survives because its strongest claims are now separated from its assumptions:

\text{Prior art} \rightarrow \text{identified boundary} \rightarrow \text{formal interface} \rightarrow \text{falsifiable hypotheses} \rightarrow \text{controlled experiment}

If the experiment succeeds, CEMI establishes evidence that a physical chemical dynamical substrate can complement digital memory for an LLM agent in the idle regime. If it fails, the resulting measurements define the limits of such an architecture. Either outcome is scientifically useful.

